      "created_at": "2015-11-22T13:26:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would either release pnp files and let people build a cult following, or maybe put an advetiser in the shipment of your other products. Maybe keep demoing it at the the boorh this next year conventions. I think you can overcome the niche aspect if you can get more buzz going on about it.</p>",
